Wyoh Step 6.8 (user request 2026-10-09): two key selections for gamepad typing.

Adds --cursors: a pastel green (0) and a pastel red (1) selection on the keys,
moved and pressed by commands on standard input, one per line:
  move <0|1> <up|down|left|right>    press <0|1>
Options --cursor0/--cursor1/--cursor-text set the colours, --home0/--home1 the
start positions (fractions of the keyboard). Applies to wvkbd 0.15 with
patch -p1; GPL-3.0-or-later, like wvkbd.

